23
00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.000
Sweet dreams?

24
00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:19.000
Your little lenochka was spying on us.

25
00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.936
And now. she's going
to tell me all her secrets.

26
00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.936
Go back to your bed.

27
00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.960
